     Keep the five columns in this order every time: Date Noticed, Source, Change Summary, Sectors or Companies Affected, Action Taken. Consistency of format matters more than the tool you use to keep it. A spreadsheet lets you sort and filter by sector later; a notebook is fine if you are willing to flip pages. Choose whichever you will actually maintain weekly, not the one that looks most impressive.
