   <p>Return to Kavita's report card. The school did not average her seven subject grades by picking the best one, or ignore Mathematics because English was strong. It added every subject's contribution into one GPA that reflected the whole child. The Canon Quality Score works the same way: you simply add the seven dimension scores together.</p>
